      "raw": "Hey, folks!\n\nI thought it'd be interesting to have a poll where people input what parts (Background, Power Source, Archetype, Personality) they used in their heroes, so that we can see which ones are the most popular. Here are those polls. (Also feel free to input your players' choices if they're not on this Forum. I'm not sure, however, if one user can input multiple responses. I guess we'll find out!)\n\nPlease only input characters built using the Constructed or Freeform Methods, because the Guided Method already includes a probability aspect which makes certain outcomes most likely, and this poll is meant to represent what people *choose*, not what the dice roll for them.\n\n[poll type=regular results=always chartType=pie]\n# Backgrounds\n* Upper Class\n* Blank Slate\n* Struggling\n* Adventurer\n* Unremarkable\n* Law Enforcement\n* Academic\n* Tragic\n* Performer\n* Military\n* Retired\n* Criminal\n* Medical\n* Anachronistic\n* Exile\n* Former Villain\n* Interstellar\n* Dynasty\n* Otherworldly\n* Created\n[/poll]\n\n[poll name=poll2 type=regular results=always chartType=pie]\n# Power Sources\n* Accident\n* Training\n* Genetic\n* Experimentation\n* Mystical\n* Nature\n* Relic\n* Powered Suit\n* Radiation\n* Tech Upgrades\n* Supernatural\n* Artificial Being\n* Cursed\n* Alien\n* Genius\n* Cosmos\n* Extradimensional\n* Unknown\n* Higher Power\n* The Multiverse\n[/poll]\n\n[poll name=poll3 type=regular results=always chartType=pie]\n# Archetypes\n* Speedster\n* Shadow\n* Physical Powerhouse\n* Marksman\n* Blaster\n* Close-Quarters Combatant\n* Armoured\n* Flyer\n* Elemental Manipulator\n* Robot/Cyborg\n* Sorcerer\n* Psychic\n* Transporter\n* Minion-Maker\n* Wild Card\n* Form-Changer\n* Gadgeteer\n* Reality-Shaper\n* Divided\n* Modular\n[/poll]\n\n[poll name=poll4 type=regular results=always chartType=pie]\n# Personalities\n* Lone Wolf\n* Natural Leader\n* Impulsive\n* Mischievous\n* Sarcastic\n* Distant\n* Stalwart\n* Fast Talking\n* Inquisitive\n* A